          "order": 3,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "maleva angata ! sicuayananga inia ku pinacunan tjayamadju!",
          "chineseText": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66215/924197.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "23-hordequest-find-4",
          "order": 4,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "ui lja! uri isugasi tjen nusauny, pusaladju ta mapuljat.",
          "chineseText": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66215/924198.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "23-hordequest-find-5",
          "order": 5,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "ui! tjara pusaladj aken!",
          "chineseText": "好的，我一定會！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66215/924199.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "23-hordequest-find-6",
          "order": 6,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "vaik aken a lemava ta uri sicekaw a nanemanga.",
          "chineseText": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66215/924200.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/mom.png",
          "background": "1-2.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "23-hordequest-find-7",
          "order": 7,
          "speaker": "classmate",
          "speakerName": "同學",
          "indigenousText": "pay! ku pusaladjay!",
          "chineseText": "我來幫忙！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66215/924201.mp3",
          "imageUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/interact/hordequest/img/find/girl.png",
          "background": "1-1.png"
        },
        {
          "id": "23-hordequest-find-8",
          "order": 8,
          "speaker": "mother",
          "speakerName": "媽媽",
          "indigenousText": "ui, kiciulu tjanuaen numaya!",
          "chineseText": "好，你跟我來！",
          "audioUrl": "https://web.klokah.tw/text/sound/66215/924202.mp3",
